WEBVTT

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:36.550
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. 

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.320
Laughing, 

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.100
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. 

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.830
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... 

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.540
Isn't this too much fun? 

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.120
For real? 

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.330
I mean, thanks! 

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.660
Even if I lose my way,  

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.270
my heart's egg 

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.040
will be all right. Come back 

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.730
to me! 

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.510
Hey, when we're together... 

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.230
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.840
Because you're here... 

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.490
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:17.360
I'm always with you...  

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.080
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.760
One more time,  

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.370
unlock my heart! 

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.140
I love you.  

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.600
All of you.  

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.490
I want to be next to you. 

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.800
Okay? 

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:36.950
Love ya! 

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:01.460
Jeez.

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:03.600
This X Egg is way too fast!

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.760
Amu-chan, let's take a break.

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:08.540
We should take the peaceful path by raising the white flag.

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:09.140
Not a chance!

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:12.470
I'm all worn out.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.560
Wait!

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.090
Here it comes!

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:28.910
I can't take it anymore.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:29.910
Um...

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:30.710
Chairman!

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:34.310
The X Egg and Amu-chi are moving through the school building's second floor, as planned!

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:35.610
Go ahead!

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:36.680
Roger that.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:40.280
Hey, are you sure we shouldn't help?

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.100
Yes.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:45.400
This X Egg is extremely mobile.

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.970
We who cannot Character Transform would be unable to deal with it.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:52.180
The only cards we can rely on are the Joker and Queen.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:59.720
Star Class vs. Moon Class! Cheerleader Brings It On!

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:59.720
Episode 30

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:04.460
Okay.

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:05.460
This is going according to plan.

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:07.110
We'll drive it up to the roof!

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.870
Rima will trap it and then...

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.220
That's when you...

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:11.770
Finish it off with Open Heart!

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.720
Was that...

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.810
Clown Drop's special attack.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.140
Juggling Party.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:32.820
Hey.

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:34.470
That wasn't the plan.

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:36.270
Why did you break the egg?

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.430
It would've been a pain to trap it.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:42.270
When you break an egg, you're breaking someone's dreams!

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:46.000
If I use my Open Heart, the egg returns to its owner-

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:46.810
That's stupid.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.500
You're drenched in sweat.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.520
Why are you trying so hard?

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:56.380
Isn't it the Joker's duty to hunt X Eggs?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.520
I don't know anything about that Open Heart stuff,

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:02.320
but will something good happen if you return the egg to its owner?

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:03.680
Something good?

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.640
Whatever. We're finished, right?

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:08.360
Hold on!

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:13.830
What's the matter?

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:19.510
Rima, she's here to pick you up!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:24.790
Mom, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:32.960
My X-marked egg still hasn't come back.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:35.970
I've felt out of it ever since the new term started.

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:37.200
I see.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:41.060
Utau-chan's arch-nemesis, Hinamori Amu, is depressed.

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.220
Hinamori-san!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.020
What are you doing?

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:44.940
Shut up!

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:47.970
My existence is top secret!

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.110
Huh?

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.420
Where's Rima-tan?

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.970
She already left.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:55.470
It's troublesome when you don't follow my plan.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:56.940
S-Sorry.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.100
When the execution team takes arbitrary action,

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.060
any brilliant strategy will be nothing more than talk.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:06.060
I'll need you to submit a report on today's failure.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:06.560
What?

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.940
I followed the plan!

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:10.620
Collective responsibility.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:12.680
What? No way.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.460
I'm home.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.050
Too hard.

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:20.510
Even though I Character Transformed,

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.350
all that running really wore me out.

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:25.410
My muscles are definitely going to ache tomorrow.

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:28.420
And the egg ended up being broken.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:30.290
Good work, though, Amu-chan.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.640
You, too.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:35.090
This is when you should let me take care of things!

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.720
Have some herbal tea to help ease the fatigue.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.000
Thanks.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.080
You know, that's rather unfortunate.

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.020
Considering how important tomorrow is.

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:44.570
Huh?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:45.720
That...

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:50.740
Th-That's right.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:51.810
Tomorrow is...

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:58.830
Seiyo Academy Moon Class vs. Star Class

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:58.830
Ball Game Tournament

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.480
The Seiyo Academy...

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:56.210
Moon Class vs. Star Class...

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.790
Ball Game Tournament!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.810
Yay!

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:04.480
The contest that only comes once a year!

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:08.460
The Moon Class will definitely, definitely, definitely win!

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.580
Yeah!

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:12.500
You won't be smiling for long!

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.320
We have no intention of losing!

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:16.270
Because the Star Class has...

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.730
The all-around athlete...

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.240
The cool girl...

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:22.100
Amu-chan, to save the day!

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:25.050
Yes? You rang?

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.530
Huh?!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.420
Wh-What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:29.850
A-Are you okay?

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:35.810
It would appear to be my turn!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:38.210
We've been waiting, Saya-sama!

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:42.610
First, I shall donate this volleyball, made of pure gold.

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:43.840
Serving that will kill you!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.350
Receiving that will kill you, too!

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:49.060
Next, we have these pure gold line markers.

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:51.080
But the lines are still drawn in lime!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.290
Oddly stingy, somehow.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.850
On top of that...

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:57.970
The winning team

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.060
will receive this trophy, made of pure gold!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:03.160
We want!

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.390
When she goes this far...

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.390
It's pretty incredible.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.390
Fantastic!

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:09.630
That's our Rima-sama!

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:11.810
You even look fantastic in a gym uniform!

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:13.660
R-Rima-sama.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.560
If you don't mind, could I take a picture?

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.250
What?

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:17.470
You trying to outdo us?

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:18.420
Shut up!

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:19.640
What was that?

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:19.640
Why you...

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:20.280
What's that?

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:21.980
Get outta my way!

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:25.910
Hinamori Amu is glaring at Rima-sama!

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:26.240
Huh?

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.730
Protect Rima-sama!

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.310
Our lives for the Queen!

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:32.560
Man, that's just pathetic.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.550
Don't worry about it, Amu-chan.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.600
Because we...

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.560
Are the Amu-chan faction!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.310
Give me a break.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.970
The opening ceremony will begin shortly.

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:46.770
All students, please gather on the grounds.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.620
All judges should gather at the main area.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:54.370
Oh, but anyone who doesn't feel like participating can come to the tent to rest.

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:58.230
You're such a kidder, Nikaidou-sensei.

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.510
Huh? Did it sound like I was joking?

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:01.310
Huh?

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.620
No good!

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.280
I have to get fired up!

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.760
Fired up! Fired up!

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.720
Hinamori-san!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.940
Ta-Tadase-kun, what's with the outfit?

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:19.220
Oh, this?

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:21.790
I'm the captain of the Star Class's cheering squad.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.510
I'm the Moon Class's.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.710
But the uniform's a little big on me.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:27.850
Does it look strange?

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.290
N-Not really.

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:33.600
Plus, it's not like I think that the fact that it's all baggy makes you cute.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:34.360
Amu-chan.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:36.680
Hinamori Amu has a uniform fetish.

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:38.580
King, it's almost time.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.060
Ah, so it is.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:40.640
Well then...

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:44.520
I'm looking forward to seeing how well you do.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.420
The cheering competition will come down to the last point.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.900
We won't lose, King.

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:51.180
The Star Class won't lose either.

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:52.270
Amu-chi!

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:55.840
I'm going to send that ball outta here in the fifth grade kickball match!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.930
The Moon Class will definitely win!

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:04.120
I guess since you're tired from chasing X Eggs, you won't be a concern.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.100
Amu-chi's on fire!

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:08.720
Say something?

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:11.220
Absolutely nothing!

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:15.950
Guardian Character Exclusive

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:15.950
Ball Game Tournament

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.180
The Guardian Character Exclusive...

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:15.930
Ball Game Tournament!

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.450
Thank you all for assembling.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.570
We have some new friends among us today,

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:24.680
so I would like to use this opportunity for we Guardian Characters to interact.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:31.340
And while we're at it, shall we push my plan for world domination forward as well?

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.760
Huh? We're missing someone.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.180
It's Kusukusu-dechu.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:40.620
It'd be more fun if everyone played together.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:42.850
She doesn't have a cooperative personality-dechu.

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:47.830
All right, before we once again review the appeal of world domination...

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:48.720
You!

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:49.590
Yes?

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:50.850
Who are you?

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:54.050
El. Whose Guardian Character I am is still top secret.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:55.240
I know.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:55.960
It's Hoshina-

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:56.630
Uta-

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.400
Top secret.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:03.410
Musashi-tan, is it okay for you to leave Kairi-tan's side?

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.970
Naturally, as I am currently on a mission.

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:06.880
You are?

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.430
Do not concern yourself with it.

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:10.400
Yes.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.680
Yes, I understand.

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:16.680
The tournament is about to begin, so I'll contact you later.

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:18.280
Until then.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.100
There's no way we'll lose, Hinamori Amu!

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.660
On your marks, get set...

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:46.890
Hooray! Hooray! Star Class!

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:50.390
Hooray! Hooray! Moon Class!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.950
Whoosh.

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:57.150
I predict a home run.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:11:00.990
I won't let that happen!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:21.950
Goal!

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.180
First place!

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:24.040
Well done.

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.210
I shall bestow upon you a reward.

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:26.100
Yay!

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.020
What is it?

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:28.430
This!

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:33.010
It may look like an ordinary picture, but it is not.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:35.790
Once we take over the world, it will become a premium item.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:38.450
It will undoubtedly be a shining treasure!

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:39.280
I'll give it to you.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.100
Hey!

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.610
The thought is more than enough.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:42.520
You, too?

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:51.310
Okay, let's start the match!

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.650
Come on, Misaki!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.000
You could at least hold back a little!

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:00.390
Aren't you on the volleyball team?

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:02.020
Naive, Hinamori Amu!

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:04.180
There is no such thing as holding back, in love or sports!

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.330
The probability of the Star Class winning is

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:09.110
under 0.00001%!

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:12.900
Let's give it our best, guys!

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:13.890
Yeah!

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.220
Point, Moon Class.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.980
Are you okay, Wakana-chan?

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:22.960
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.970
But you're bleeding.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.140
You should rest.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.690
Is there anyone who can take her place?

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:32.410
Rima-sama, have some iced tea.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:33.490
Here's a towel.

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:34.430
Over there!

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:36.010
What?

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:40.110
When a celebrity is wearing big sunglasses, it means you shouldn't talk to her.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:40.930
Didn't you know that?

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:42.320
I didn't.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:45.410
You can't sit out when the rest of the class is trying their best.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:46.470
Come on, let's go.

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.820
You're all sweaty again. How stupid.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:53.350
It's not like winning or losing will show up on your report card.

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:58.060
Is something wrong, Himamori-san?

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:00.560
Why's she asking Mashiro-san?

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:02.270
She should just leave her alone.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:03.570
Go away.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:06.690
If you're too persistent, you'll lose followers.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:10.430
I need you more than followers right now.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:13.930
Besides, I never wanted them in the first place.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.540
So let's go.

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:19.310
Just try it for a bit, okay?

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:28.470
Our beloved Rima-sama has stepped onto the court!

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:32.970
No way.

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:34.150
She's so slow!

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:35.850
But that's still cute!

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:37.730
Ma-Mashiro-san.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:39.970
Are you bad at sports?

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.390
I quit, after all.

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:42.060
Huh?

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:44.060
But then we'll have to forfeit.

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:45.220
I don't care.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:49.430
Hooray! Hooray! Mashiro-san!

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:53.560
Hooray! Hooray! Mashiro-san! Hooray! Hooray! Mashiro-san!

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:54.970
Tadase-kun!

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:58.420
Come on, everybody, together!

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:01.330
This might not be the time to worry about Mashiro-san.

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.520
Let's focus on making the Star Class victorious!

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:08.720
Hooray! Hooray! Mashiro-san!

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:12.720
Hooray! Hooray! Mashiro-san! Hooray! Hooray! Mashiro-san!

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:15.000
See?

00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:17.100
How stupid.

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:19.550
I'm just going to stand here.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:22.810
So protect me from the ball, like a proper servant.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:25.640
Okay.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:27.790
There!

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:29.180
Too easy!

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:32.310
There!

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:37.300
Won't this ruin my magnificent kingly garb?

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:39.050
Kiseki, it's going your way!

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:40.560
Honestly.

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:44.580
An X Egg?

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.360
What are you doing?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:51.580
Pay me no mind; follow the X Egg!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.100
They already did.

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.400
We need to let everyone know, quickly!

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.450
Let's hurry-dechu!

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.180
Disperse!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:00.210
You could at least be a little concerned about me.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:03.190
The King's Guardian Character is unpopular.

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:07.110
All right!

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:08.560
Whatever, not bad.

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:13.820
Hey, hey!

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:15.650
Look at that! That!

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:18.020
Amu-chan!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:20.390
What did you say?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.180
Why now, of all times?

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:26.770
Time-out, Star Class!

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:27.790
Got it!

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:30.180
I'll take a little break as well.

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.530
This is bad!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.080
It's 12 to 4!

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.350
It's pretty obvious we're going to lose.

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:38.250
And a certain someone isn't even trying.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.180
Hey, where's Hinamori-san?

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.060
Ran, let's do it!

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:45.720
Right!

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:49.640
My heart:

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:51.020
Unlock!

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:31.840
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:35.930
Amu-chan, over there!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.310
Let's go.

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:41.760
We should join them.

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:43.930
It'd be better if we didn't.

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:45.520
Huh? Why?

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.550
Did something happen?

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:50.270
The Guardians are all together.

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:51.610
What?

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.020
What are they talking about?

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:56.710
If we leave as well, the commotion will only increase.

00:16:56.710 --> 00:17:00.100
Jeez! It had to happen now of all times!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.680
The Queen isn't moving.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:06.430
How strong is the Joker, truly?

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:08.390
Wait!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.020
This one's fast, too!

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.690
It's like déjà vu!

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:18.600
If you consider X Eggs to be balls, this would just be another ball game.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.720
Who told you to say something clever?

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:26.870
Now's our chance.

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.670
Close the doors and trap it inside.

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:29.430
Roger!

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:36.600
Okay! Just as planned!

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:37.770
Negative Heart-

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:40.490
What should we do next?

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:42.820
Don't open the door, dummies!

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:45.590
Now we've done it.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:51.970
Man.

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:53.120
You're not getting away!

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:54.670
Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.430
Hop!

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:56.180
Step!

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.060
Jump!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:01.060
We're above the grounds now!

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:03.350
It's a flying cheerleader!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:04.440
No way!

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:07.560
It's way too humiliating to be dressed like this in front of everyone!

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:12.410
I guess that's not important.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:13.710
We have to catch it first!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:14.640
Yep, yep!

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:16.910
Wait!

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:17.810
Jeez!

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:24.350
I can't just stand here!

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:26.810
Hinamori-senpai is too wonderful!

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:30.680
Hooray! Hooray! Hinamori! Hooray! Hooray! Hinamori!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.680
Using cheerleading as camouflage for hunting X Eggs is pretty clever.

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:41.540
Amulet Heart!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:45.520
Okay, we need to join in to make this look like part of the cheering contest!

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.100
Yes.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:50.890
Fight! Fight! Star Class! Fight! Fight! Star Class!

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.090
Whoa.

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:53.990
Captain, us, too!

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:55.020
Understood.

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:59.890
Hooray! Hooray! Moon Class! Hooray! Hooray! Moon Class!

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:05.720
Chance!

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:09.020
Negative Heart:

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:11.710
Lock On!

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:22.330
Open Heart!

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:28.640
So that's Open Heart.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.810
The power of the Joker.

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.890
Capture complete!

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:49.450
I got carried away!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.720
Wow.

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:55.720
Huh?

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:57.130
That's our Amu-chan!

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.520
You were super cute!

00:19:58.520 --> 00:19:59.720
You've got that right!

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:01.020
Hinamori-san!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:02.240
Could this be love?

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:03.220
Exactly!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:06.420
Did I actually fool everyone?

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:07.890
It was still embarrassing, though.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.060
Oh well.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:12.750
I was injured, but after seeing that I feel all better!

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.710
12 to 4 is nothing!

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:16.500
Let's go all out!

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:17.560
Yeah!

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.910
You did it, Amu-chi!

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:22.850
Guess so.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.950
And the tournament was over in no time.

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:44.770
Who won?

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:46.850
The Star Class, of course!

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:46.870
Moon Class            Star Class

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:53.270
Rima's all sweaty!

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:55.060
Ma-Mashiro-san.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.930
G-Good job.

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:59.100
You tried really hard in the second half.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.630
Rats, the Moon Class lost.

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.340
It was still super fun!

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:08.220
Agreed!

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:11.730
The nation's in ruins, but the land remains.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:14.570
This is what it means to smile upon defeat.

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:18.730
Whether you win or lose, it feels good to go all out!

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:20.220
Yeah! Yeah!

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:21.410
Good work!

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:23.390
It was all thanks to Amulet Heart.

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:24.280
What?

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:26.470
Amulet Heart, not me?

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.560
Ah, sorry.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:28.520
That's not what I meant.

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:30.930
Just kidding.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:38.110
Hello.

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:40.350
The tournament just ended.

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:41.950
Good work.

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:43.600
So? How was it?

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:45.420
Hinamori Amu.

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:49.470
I can see why people would assume she was a failure of a Joker,

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:52.350
but also how she could cause Nikaidou-san's downfall.

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.890
Well, it's not like beating Yuu is a major accomplishment.

00:21:57.430 --> 00:21:59.600
So? Is it doable?

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:01.170
You can count on me.

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:05.740
As promised, I'll learn the Seiyo Academy Guardians' secrets,

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:07.950
Yukari-neesan.

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:11.080
I'm counting on you, Kairi.

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.130
You can't think that there's 

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.510
an answer out there somewhere, you see. 

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:50.810
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. 

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:53.050
Ain't that cool? 

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.000
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... 

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.330
Yup, it's love! 

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:05.890
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. 

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.660
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. 

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.270
Try bustin' through. 

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.640
Face forward, raise your head up high. 

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:20.550
There's no time to cry. 

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.800
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! 

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:27.800
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.050
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! 

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:35.030
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. 

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:39.730
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:49.250
I'm number one today! Yay!

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:52.350
Next week is the event we've all been waiting for!

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:54.000
The first visit to my house!

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:54.640
Huh?

00:23:54.640 --> 00:23:55.920
Nobody was waiting for that.

00:23:55.920 --> 00:23:58.310
My little brother Tsubasa will make his first appearance, too!

00:23:58.310 --> 00:24:01.000
You'll see plenty of my big sister charm!

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.570
Oh no, Tsubasa-kun's crying!

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:04.390
What do I do, Amu-chi?

00:24:04.390 --> 00:24:05.970
Feed him? Diaper? Hold him?

00:24:05.970 --> 00:24:07.550
I don't know!

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:09.520
You're not acting like an older sister.

00:24:10.410 --> 00:24:11.520
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.520 --> 00:24:13.350
Pretty Baby ☆ Huge Riot!

00:24:13.350 --> 00:24:16.300
Since I'm a baby character, babysitting's impossible for me!

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:17.780
You guys take care of it!

00:24:17.780 --> 00:24:19.460
How can you just abandon us?
